### Acceptance Criteria Coverage

| Criteria | How Covered |
|---|---|
| Daily scheduler run | `@Scheduled(cron = "0 0 0 * * *")` in `BillingScheduler` |
| Bills subscriptions due today | `findByNextBillingDateAndStatusIn(today, ACTIVE)` |
| Idempotent invoice generation | Check `existsBySubscriptionIdAndBillingJobId` before creating |
| Skip Suspended/Cancelled | Only `ACTIVE` passed to repository query |
| Apply tax & discount rules | Done in `InvoiceServiceImpl` steps 3 & 4 |
| Update next billing date | Calculated by `calculateNextBillingDate()` after success |
| Log billing summary | `BillingJob` record updated with counts, total, errors |
